{"content_hash": "82b1894da3f8ce04", "version_id": 1061, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "New calm game Green New Life comes out on December 7", "title_zh": "平静新游戏《绿色新生活》于12月7日推出", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 87, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "A small studio made a gentle plant game. It arrives on Steam very soon. Players can grow trees and meet friendly animals.", "lead_zh": "一家小工作室制作了一款温和的植物游戏。它很快将在Steam上推出。玩家可以种树，还能遇见友好的动物。", "preview": "Positive Impact Games made the game. Gamirror Games will sell it. On December 7, Green New Life comes to Steam. It is a calm plant game for ", "preview_zh": "Positive Impact Games制作了这款游戏。Gamirror Games将负责销售。12月7日，《绿色新生活》登陆Steam。这是一款适合所有人的平静植物游戏。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1044, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 27.275, "size_bytes": 164592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 102, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c391479e/content/data/versions/1061.json", "paragraphs": ["Positive Impact Games made the game. Gamirror Games will sell it. On December 7, Green New Life comes to Steam. It is a calm plant game for everyone.", "In the game, you put seeds in the ground. You meet old nature spirits. You also hug cute people and small animals. The land becomes green again.", "There is no timer and no rush. You play at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds help you relax. A free demo is already on Steam. Many people like it."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Positive Impact Games制作了这款游戏。Gamirror Games将负责销售。12月7日，《绿色新生活》登陆Steam。这是一款适合所有人的平静植物游戏。", "在游戏中，你把种子放进土里。你会遇见古老的自然精灵。你还会拥抱可爱的人和的小动物。土地重新变得绿意盎然。", "没有计时器，也没有催促。你按自己的节奏游玩。柔和的音乐和自然的声音帮助你放松。Steam上已经有免费试玩版。很多人喜欢它。"], "body": "Positive Impact Games made the game. Gamirror Games will sell it. On December 7, Green New Life comes to Steam. It is a calm plant game for everyone.\n\nIn the game, you put seeds in the ground. You meet old nature spirits. You also hug cute people and small animals. The land becomes green again.\n\nThere is no timer and no rush. You play at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds help you relax. A free demo is already on Steam. Many people like it.", "body_zh": "Positive Impact Games制作了这款游戏。Gamirror Games将负责销售。12月7日，《绿色新生活》登陆Steam。这是一款适合所有人的平静植物游戏。\n\n在游戏中，你把种子放进土里。你会遇见古老的自然精灵。你还会拥抱可爱的人和的小动物。土地重新变得绿意盎然。\n\n没有计时器，也没有催促。你按自己的节奏游玩。柔和的音乐和自然的声音帮助你放松。Steam上已经有免费试玩版。很多人喜欢它。", "text": "Positive Impact Games made the game. Gamirror Games will sell it. On December 7, Green New Life comes to Steam. It is a calm plant game for everyone. In the game, you put seeds in the ground. You meet old nature spirits. You also hug cute people and small animals. The land becomes green again. There is no timer and no rush. You play at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds help you relax. A free demo is already on Steam. Many people like it.", "vocab": [{"word": "game", "pos": "noun", "zh": "游戏", "note": "最基础的名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "plant", "pos": "verb", "zh": "种植", "note":